		### engine error - the atomic pair rule in its .gui form. A DESIGN REFUSAL,
		### NOT A BUG FIX: vanilla gates the manufacture of claims behind a LEARNING
		### investment and a Court Chaplain's council task (task_fabricate_claim,
		### GAME\common\council_tasks\00_court_chaplain_tasks.txt:1088, its outcome
		### keyed to learning at :1120/:1126/:1132), so buying a finished claim here
