		### ITEM 2.3. tnt_hook_p is now a TIER INDEX 0..3, so the row's own
		### `visible` still reads correctly - tier 0 IS "no hook" - and the detail
		### column names the tier instead of standing empty. TntHookTier is the
		### one-expression four-way loc pick (data_binding/tnt_macros.txt).
