		########################################################
		### ITEM 19 - THE FOUR PEOPLE TERMS, RECEIVING SIDE.
		### Same order, same shapes and the same X rule as the _p group above -
		### independence has no X because no gate-free clearer is registered for it.
		### _r means the PARTNER gives: his hostage, his child, his courtiers, and
		### his release of the player from fealty.
